================================================================================
(1) tools/round54-replay-code-audit.py - a TOTAL read budget for the code leg
================================================================================

Rationale: the frozen clause bounds each maps ROW at 64 MiB but not the SUM over
rows.  The number of executable mappings of one tree file is bounded only by the
audited process's own address space, so the leg's total read from /proc/<pid>/mem
is unbounded.  Measured on this host, real kernel, 20 executable rows of exactly
ROW_CAP each: 1,342,177,280 bytes = 1.25 GiB read in 0.24 s, no problem reported.

